# Jötun Grunt {1}{W}, 4/4, "Cumulative upkeep--Put two cards from a single graveyard on the bottom of their owner's library."
# (CR 702.24a). Bot1 has four Lotus Petals in their graveyard (two of them paid for the Grunt) and Bot2 two. At Bot1's turn 3
# upkeep the Grunt gets an age counter and Bot1 puts two cards of their own graveyard on the bottom of their library. At turn 5
# the second age counter makes it two such payments, a graveyard chosen separately for each (the ruling): two cards of Bot2's
# graveyard, and the two left in Bot1's. All four go to the bottoms of their owners' libraries and both graveyards are empty.

